// OPEN (engine-expected-failures.json): the condition of an if in a method body names a variable the branch
// declares. To KIELER the condition is inside the branch's scope and reads the local (0 there), so the else branch
// runs and o is 100; the engine's name resolution takes the chart's N (6) and o is 1.
scchart Main {
  output int o
  int N = 6
  method int get() { int r = 0 if (N > 4) { int N = 1 r = N } else { r = 100 } return r }
  initial state A do o = get() go to A
}
